11:27:47.989 | Alongside a perilous drop.
11:27:47.997 | Cerulean waters preside, fathom and depths stirred to roiling currents by the pervasive will of Neraeos Pelagia, Lord of the Sea. Vines have overtaken this location. The sun sets, its dimming rays lancing across the sky and lighting the dim edges of cloud that hang there. A slender ledge pushes out and away from the safety of the mountain's face, the narrow overhang descending gradually into wide gap several feet deep. Smaller rocks and stones skitter wildly over the unfettered edge, plummeting down onto the rocks and boulders below. Jagged outcrops of rock force a wide berth around the bulk of the mountain, as the pathway skirts dangerously close to the edge. There are 2 hulking phantom spiders here. Twinned albino orbs gleam upon the hilt of a crimson-hued daegger as it exudes its malevolent presence across the surroundings. There are 7 corpses of a shade of might here. There are 6 corpses of a shade of nature here. There are 4 corpses of a shade of magic here. A pile of tattered black robes lies here, stained by the ectoplasm of a slain Icosse, Mirrored Ire. A razor-beaked falcon looms overhead, seeking prey. Hands of rotting flesh and white bone push up from the ground. The surroundings are distorted, as if viewed through water. An unnatural darkness cloaks the location. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a hulking phantom spider. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her right. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Imperial Sommelier Crixos is here. He wields a Scimitar of Eagles in each hand. Akri is here, hidden. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and Agith'maal's ire in her right. Valkyri, Seeker of Elocution is here. She wields a Mhaldorian morning star in each hand.
