11:29:12.618 | Cerulean waters preside, fathom and depths stirred to roiling currents by the pervasive will of Neraeos Pelagia, Lord of the Sea. Vines have overtaken this location. The sun sinks toward the cloudless horizon, shining out radiant and fiery from the western skies. Downy moss clings to the nooks and crannies dotting the surface of this rocky mountain face, adding a dash of green to an otherwise wholly grey exterior. Small nests perch within tiny alcoves riddling Mount Piraeus' western side, their proud owners flitting around in a never-ending hunt for nourishment. A selection of weather-beaten spruce bushes flourish in a sheltered section next to the rocky mountain trail, fragile frames lining the craggy path as it disappears into the distance. Glaring at its surroundings with a single eye, an ageing mountain lion prowls here. A phantom spider lurks in the shadows, the outline of its hulking frame scarcely discernible. A razor-beaked falcon looms overhead, seeking prey. The surroundings are distorted, as if viewed through water. An unnatural darkness cloaks the location. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a hulking phantom spider. She wields an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her left hand and a Shield of Absorption in her right. Imperial Sommelier Crixos is here. He wields a Scimitar of Eagles in each hand. Akri is here, hidden. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and Agith'maal's ire in her right. Valkyri, Seeker of Elocution is here. She wields a Mhaldorian morning star in each hand.
